          "headline": "B-Roll Reel from a Brief",
          "comment": [
            "Turn one line of direction into a cut b-roll reel.\n\n",
            "The two shots share a subject and a look, so they cut together: a wide establishing shot, then a detail shot.\n\n",
            "Both prompts inherit the same look note — that shared line is what stops the two clips from feeling unrelated."
          ]
